    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nPRIME COMMERCIAL PREMISES\r\nLOWER JAMES STREET, CLAREMORRIS, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nc.4,000 SQ. FT. TWO-STOREY COMMERCIAL PREMISES\r\nREADY FOR FITTING OUT\r\nFOR OUTRIGHT SALE\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial commercial premises in the thriving business district of Lower James Street, Claremorris.\r\n\r\nThis prime town centre property offers exceptional potential for a wide range of commercial, retail, office, showroom or service-based enterprises.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor: c.2,000 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: c.2,000 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: c.4,000 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nThe property is substantially complete, with some finishing works remaining. These can be completed to suit the requirements and specification of the proposed purchaser.\r\n\r\nA major feature of the property is its large street-front display window, providing excellent visibility and exposure in one of Claremorris' busiest commercial locations.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• c.4,000 sq. ft. over two floors\r\n• Prime town centre location\r\n• Large street-front display window\r\n• Ready for fitting out to purchaser's specification\r\n• Excellent commercial potential\r\n• Suitable for retail, office, showroom or service use\r\n• Strong footfall and passing traffic\r\n• Located in a thriving business area\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Situated on Lower James Street, Claremorris\r\n• Walking distance to all town amenities\r\n• Excellent accessibility from the N17\r\n• Centrally located within one of Mayo's busiest commercial towns\r\n• Convenient to Knock Airport, Castlebar, Ballina and Galway routes\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €450,000 O.N.O.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
